    },
    {
      "id": 99,
      "msgctxt": "558888",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Aware of the danger,\nI look down the stairs to the second floor.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 100,
      "msgctxt": "558956",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "The Noise has taken over the second floor\nand is pressing towards the third floor with clear speed.\nI have to run #C000246204up#CDEF even higher,\nor I#['m gonna]['ll]# end up like #C236196003Shinji#CDEF……",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 101,
      "msgctxt": "559164",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "―is what it says on the door leading to the rooftop.\nIt used to be a place for students to relax,\nbut there were people doing dangerous things,\nso it's not allowed anymore.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 102,
      "msgctxt": "559340",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I've come to classroom 3-A.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 103,
      "msgctxt": "559368",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Coming to a higher grade's classroom\nfor no reason is kinda awkward.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 104,
      "msgctxt": "559440",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "The inside of the classroom's been taken over by Noise.\nI have to keep going #C000246204up#CDEF……!",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 105,
      "msgctxt": "559544",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I've come to classroom 3-B.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 106,
      "msgctxt": "559572",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Not a soul in sight.\nThey must've either left straight for home to study\nfor entrance exams, or they went to study at the library.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 107,
      "msgctxt": "559704",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "It depresses me knowing that\nI'll have to deal with the same soon enough.\nI decide to leave in a hurry and forget about entrance exams.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 108,
      "msgctxt": "559840",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I've come to classroom 3-C.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 109,
      "msgctxt": "559868",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "No matter how hard I think about it,\nI can't remember, so I decided to leave.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 110,
      "msgctxt": "559948",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "President #C236196003Issei#CDEF isn't in the Student Council Room.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 111,
      "msgctxt": "560016",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I don't have any particular business here,\nso I decide to take my leave.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 112,
      "msgctxt": "560092",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I can't get into the broadcasting room because it's locked.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 113,
      "msgctxt": "560152",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "This is a supply room.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 114,
      "msgctxt": "560176",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "No one really comes up to the third floor,\nso I'm not really sure what this supply room is used for.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 115,
      "msgctxt": "560280",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "This place is also covered with Noise and tendrils.\nI have keep running #C000246204up#CDEF……!",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 116,
      "msgctxt": "560376",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "This is the multimedia room.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 117,
      "msgctxt": "560408",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "This room is always locked.\nWe've gotta use it for something\nat least once before graduation, right?",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 118,
      "msgctxt": "560512",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "This is a fire hydrant.\nYou use it when a fire breaks out.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 119,
      "msgctxt": "560572",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "That much I know,\nbut I have no idea how to actually use it.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 120,
      "msgctxt": "560636",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "……and that's probably okay, right?",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 121,
      "msgctxt": "560676",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I tried to press the button for the fire alarm.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 122,
      "msgctxt": "560724",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "But the button wasn't there anymore,\njust tendrils extending from the jet-black Noise.\nThis really isn't the time to be doing this……!",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 123,
      "msgctxt": "560860",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "If a fire happened right now,\nwould I be able to use the fire extinguisher to put it out?",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 124,
      "msgctxt": "560952",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I tried going for the fire extinguisher,\nbut the pitch-black Noise cut me off before I could.\nI'll have to give up on it and run!",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 125,
      "msgctxt": "561084",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "The schedule for the construction of\nthe underground cafeteria is posted up on here.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 126,
      "msgctxt": "561172",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Looks like it'll be quite a while before they'll be done\nand the cafeteria is open again.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 127,
      "msgctxt": "561264",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I don't have time to be looking at the bulletin board.\nThe Noise is rising up from below. I have to keep going #C000246204up#CDEF!",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 128,
      "msgctxt": "561396",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "This bulletin board is filled with recruitment posters\nfor various club activities.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 129,
      "msgctxt": "561480",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Maybe it's just me, but wouldn't it be more\neffective to put this near the first-year classrooms\ninstead of the third-year ones?",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 130,
      "msgctxt": "561612",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 3,
      "en": "There's no time to look at something like that.\nI have keep running #C000246204up#CDEF……!",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 131,
      "msgctxt": "561704",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 3,
      "en": "There's no time to look at something like that.\nI have keep running #C000246204up#CDEF……!",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 132,
      "msgctxt": "561796",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "There are distinct traces of posters\nthat've been up here before.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 133,
      "msgctxt": "561864",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I wonder what kind of posters they were?",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 134,
      "msgctxt": "561908",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "An announcement concerning\nsupplementary lessons is written here.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 135,
      "msgctxt": "561976",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "The third year is harsh……",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 136,
      "msgctxt": "562004",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "This bulletin board is filled with recruitment posters\nfor various club activities.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 137,
      "msgctxt": "562088",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "……oh? Now that I take a good look,\nthere's something scribbled on the side.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 138,
      "msgctxt": "562168",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "……so #C236196003Leo#CDEF has fans even among the third-years?",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 139,
      "msgctxt": "562232",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "It's a bulletin board, but there's nothing posted here.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 140,
      "msgctxt": "562288",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Is a bulletin still a bulletin if there's nothing's on it?",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 141,
      "msgctxt": "562348",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "The schedule for movie screenings is posted.\nWonder what's on?",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 142,
      "msgctxt": "562412",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "[This week's movie:\n   Magical Girl VS Soldier ～Imperial Shakedown～]",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 143,
      "msgctxt": "562484",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "It's about a rough-and-tumble soldier\nwho faces off against a magical girl.\nThat's…… interesting, I guess?",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 144,
      "msgctxt": "562596",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "There's nothing posted on this bulletin board.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 145,
      "msgctxt": "562644",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 3,
      "en": "The boys' bathroom.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 146,
      "msgctxt": "562664",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 3,
      "en": "I don't need to go right now.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 147,
      "msgctxt": "562696",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 3,
      "en": "The boys' bathroom.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 148,
      "msgctxt": "562716",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 3,
      "en": "……yep, I don't have the guts to walk in.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 149,
      "msgctxt": "562760",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
