      "en": "I don't need to go right now.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 153,
      "msgctxt": "562920",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "How the flowing water shimmered in the setting sun was beautiful.\nI felt as though my heart was cleansed a little as well.\n……it was just tap water though.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 154,
      "msgctxt": "563080",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I opened up the locker, but all I found were\ncleaning supplies neatly and carefully arranged.\nThere was nothing out of place.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 155,
      "msgctxt": "563208",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "For Journalism Club, I do pieces on\nflowers when they're in season,\nso I go to the garden pretty often.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 156,
      "msgctxt": "563312",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "There're all kinds in bloom all year round.\nEven now, there're plenty of red and\nyellow ones out, so why not take a look?",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 157,
      "msgctxt": "563436",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "The garden is to the #C000246204right of the first floor#CDEF.\nJust head through the doors leading outside.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 158,
      "msgctxt": "563544",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "There's a chapel in the back of the courtyard,\nbut regardless of when, no one's ever there.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 159,
      "msgctxt": "563636",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "And yet it's not in disrepair……\nPretty mysterious, isn't it?",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 160,
      "msgctxt": "563700",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Looks like none of the others noticed yet.\nHow careless of them.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 161,
      "msgctxt": "563768",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "――――Hm? What's with you?\nIf it's nothing, then don't talk to me.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 162,
      "msgctxt": "563840",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Well, try your best to not get taken out\nin the preliminaries. Not that you'd know\nwhat I'm talking about anyway.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 163,
      "msgctxt": "563956",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "N-no way……\nThis wasn't supposed to…… don't tell me……\nThese, aren't the prelims……?",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 164,
      "msgctxt": "564048",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I know we're supposed to take pictures\nof the 'theme of the day' for photo club,\nbut today's theme is \"cherry#RUBS      sakura#RUBE#REND blossoms.\"",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 165,
      "msgctxt": "564196",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "What's with that!?\nWhat kinda cherry blossoms would\nbe blooming right now?",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 166,
      "msgctxt": "564272",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Someone up there's barking up\nthe#RUBS  sakura#RUBE wrong#REND tree.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 167,
      "msgctxt": "564344",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Hey, you studying for that aptitude test?",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 168,
      "msgctxt": "564388",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "……what do you think, dude?\nYou been studying, or what?",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 169,
      "msgctxt": "564448",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Me? Heh. When the test is over,\nI'M getting married to my childhood friend.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 170,
      "msgctxt": "564524",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Is this guy for real…?",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 171,
      "msgctxt": "564548",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I'll leverage parallel processing if I can run\nthat part in a subroutine―the efficiency\nwould improve dramatically…",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 172,
      "msgctxt": "564668",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Okay, since that's decided,\nlet's start looking over the source file\nas soon as we can.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 173,
      "msgctxt": "564756",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Hm? You wanna know what this is about?\nI'm thinking of ways to optimize this\nprogram I'm making in the computer club.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 174,
      "msgctxt": "564876",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "C'mon, please don't bother me.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 175,
      "msgctxt": "564908",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "What's wrong, you haven't gone home yet?",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 176,
      "msgctxt": "564952",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Tohsaka? ……yes, I saw her in the courtyard.\nIt's #C000246204at the end of the hallway,\nopposite of the supply room's side#CDEF.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 177,
      "msgctxt": "565084",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "You went to see #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF?\nThen it's about time to go home. The entrance\n#C000246204is on the first floor, straight ahead#CDEF.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 178,
      "msgctxt": "565228",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "So far, everything's gone smoothly.\nAt least, that's what the logs say: never has\nthere been trouble in the preliminaries.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 179,
      "msgctxt": "565352",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Aaaah, I'm bored.\nMaybe it's fun for people from the outside,\nbut for us, it's just plain torture.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 180,
      "msgctxt": "565452",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I wonder if anything will change.\nPubli#RUBS    We#RUBEc#REND morals don't get notified about things,\nlike events that'd change the world and such.",
